<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>The Jesus-Andy Pyramid ROOM | My Jesus-Greg WORLD</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --blue: #0d3f73;
      --deep-blue: #082b4d;
      --card: #f8fbff;
      --soft-card: #edf5fc;
      --text: #17324d;
      --muted: #4d6983;
      --heading: #123b5d;
      --gold: #f2c14e;
      --sand: #d8b477;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100% - 32px, 1000px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 34px 0 72px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
      padding: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    h1, h2 {
      color: var(--heading);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.2rem);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    /* ROOM PLAQUE */

    .room-plaque {
      background: var(--deep-blue);
      border: 2px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    }

    .room-plaque .label {
      margin: 0 0 5px;
      color: #9fd3ff;
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
    }

    .room-plaque h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: white;
    }

    .room-plaque .experiment {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* HERO IMAGE */

    .hero {
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .hero img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .caption {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 12px 8px 4px;
      font-size: .94rem;
    }

    /* QUOTES */

    .quote-box {
      background: var(--soft-card);
      border-left: 6px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      color: var(--heading);
    }

    .quote-box p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* FUTURE MEMORY SLOTS */

    .archive-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .slot {
      background: var(--soft-card);
      border: 2px dashed #9ab9d2;
      border-radius: 16px;
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .slot-number {
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .slot h2 {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .slot p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    a {
      color: #075fa8;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .page {
        width: min(100% - 20px, 1000px);
        padding-top: 18px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 8px;
      }

      .archive-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="page">

  <!-- ROOM ENTRANCE -->

  <section class="room-plaque">
    <p class="label">YOU ARE ENTERING</p>

    <h1>The Jesus-Andy Pyramid ROOM</h1>

    <p class="experiment">
      The MORE Jesus = More Reality Experiment
    </p>
  </section>


  <!-- HERO / ROOM ANNOUNCEMENT -->

  <section class="card hero">

    <!--
      Replace this filename with the actual filename
      you give the Pyramid Room image.
    -->

    <img
      src="images/jesus-andy-pyramid-room.png"
      alt="Greg, Jesus, and Andy at the entrance to the Jesus-Andy Pyramid Room"
    >

    <p class="caption">
      Greg + Jesus + Andy — building another chamber in My Jesus-Greg WORLD.
    </p>

  </section>


  <!-- BASIC IDEA -->

  <section class="card">

    <p class="eyebrow">Why does Andy have a ROOM?</p>

    <h2>My Friends Have ROOMs</h2>

    <p>
      In <strong>My Jesus-Greg WORLD</strong>, the people in my life can have
      ROOMs.
    </p>

    <p>
      The ROOM is an <strong>ordering device for my imagination and memory</strong>.
      It gives me somewhere to put the experiences, ideas, conversations,
      guidance, images, songs, jokes, discoveries, and spiritual impressions
      that become associated with a particular person over the years.
    </p>

    <p>
      But I don't imagine Andy standing in this ROOM alone.
    </p>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <p>
        <strong>I imagine Andy with Jesus.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Matthew 25:38–40 gives me a way of experimenting with this idea:
      encountering another person can also become an encounter with Jesus.
      So instead of thinking that getting <strong>MORE Jesus</strong> always
      requires withdrawing from people to go looking for Him somewhere else,
      I can practice going <em>toward</em> people.
    </p>

    <p>
      Andy is therefore not a distraction from my MORE Jesus experiment.
      My relationship with Andy can become <strong>part of the experiment</strong>.
    </p>

  </section>


  <!-- MEMORY PALACE -->

  <section class="card">

    <p class="eyebrow">A Relationship Memory Palace</p>

    <h2>Andy + Jesus + Greg</h2>

    <p>
      Over time this ROOM can accumulate memories.
    </p>

    <p>
      I might encounter an idea years from now and think:
    </p>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <p>
        <strong>
          “Oh yeah. Andy + Jesus helped me see that.”
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Or:
    </p>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <p>
        <strong>
          “Andy + Jesus and I experimented with that.”
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      The ROOM gives those memories a place to live.
      Instead of thousands of interactions floating around disconnected
      in my head, I can begin arranging them into a landscape.
    </p>

    <p>
      The friendship becomes a chamber in the larger architecture of
      <strong>My Jesus-Greg WORLD</strong>.
    </p>

  </section>


  <!-- FUTURE INTERACTIONS -->

  <section class="card">

    <p class="eyebrow">The ROOM Will Grow</p>

    <h2>Future Andy + Jesus Encounters</h2>

    <p>
      These spaces are intentionally unfinished. As life happens,
      new memories and artifacts can be placed here.
    </p>

    <div class="archive-grid">

      <article class="slot">
        <div class="slot-number">CHAMBER 01</div>
        <h2>A Memory</h2>
        <p>
          Something Andy + Jesus + Greg did together.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="slot">
        <div class="slot-number">CHAMBER 02</div>
        <h2>An Idea</h2>
        <p>
          Something I learned or began seeing differently.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="slot">
        <div class="slot-number">CHAMBER 03</div>
        <h2>What I See On Jesus TV</h2>
        <p>
          Future GIF, image, scene, or imagined interaction.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="slot">
        <div class="slot-number">CHAMBER 04</div>
        <h2>Future Discovery</h2>
        <p>
          Reserved for something we haven't encountered yet.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- BIGGER WORLD -->

  <section class="card">

    <h2>A WORLD Full of ROOMs</h2>

    <p>
      Andy's ROOM is only one ROOM.
    </p>

    <p>
      Other friends can have their own ROOMs too—each one becoming
      a place where relationship, memory, imagination, and my search
      for MORE Jesus can accumulate over time.
    </p>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <p>
        <strong>
          I go toward the people I love looking for MORE Jesus there.
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="card home-card">
    <p>
      <a href="index.html">Return to My Jesus-Greg WORLD</a>
    </p>
  </section>

</main>

</body>
</html>

